  "profile": {
    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "Melanite, formerly an experienced tester at a Columbian weapons testing company. Her contract with the company came to an end after she was infected with Oripathy. Thereafter, she came to Rhodes Island for medical treatment and entered into an agreement to become a field operator."
